__pycache__
*.pyc
.env
.git
.gitignore
*.md
docker-compose.yml

# Client timesheet scans and real employee data — must never be baked into a
# deployed image. Named explicitly rather than relying only on extension rules
# below: TIMEKEEPING/ and benchmark/ also hold .xlsx/.pdf/.json that those
# extension rules don't catch.
# Glob, not a fixed list: each client drop arrives as a new reference<N>/ folder
# full of real scans, and a hand-maintained list silently misses the next one.
reference*
reference/
reference2/
reference3/
TIMEKEEPING/
benchmark/
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.csv
